  <item>
    <title>到底要不要割席啊 |成为更好的人类特辑 Vol.10</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/645a84b7306513184c859173</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">645a84b7306513184c859173</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 09 May 2023 17:36:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，好久不见。这集播客想和大家探讨一下割席，道德立场，与自由。这也会是“成为更好的人类”特辑中的一期。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>“You must answer for who you are - if not to others, then to yourself" </span></strong><a href="https://aeon.co/essays/states-have-a-moral-responsibility-to-settle-their-debts" data-url="https://aeon.co/essays/states-have-a-moral-responsibility-to-settle-their-debts"><span>Collective Wrongs</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家微博小红书私信想听的内容：@函数ln</span></p><span></span><p><span>也欢迎给我来信：Jess11won@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>Show note:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> 理中客是一种特权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> 我们比想象中更频繁地在做割席的决定，道德立场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="277">04:37</a> 集体身份认同和集体形象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="579">09:39</a> 会有对割席的期待是因为有对集体的期待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a>我们需要道德审判不割席的人吗？为什么人们会选择不割席</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 能选择不割席也是一种特权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1408">23:28</a> 播客最后的一点话</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhr31tQ1V0wnN5URC8Vno_AWoxqa.m4a" length="24731828" type="audio/mp4"/>
