  <item>
    <title>在通勤路上，我们找寻与创造自我空间 Vol.6</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6406ba7bc5d7e6e060682f52</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6406ba7bc5d7e6e060682f52</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 07 Mar 2023 15:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期播客由耳机品牌Tezo通勤耳机赞助播出。Tezo的拼写是T-E-Z-O。Tezo持续关注女性空间，呼吁大众关注女性通勤中的不便和困扰，致力于提升用户通勤体验感。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Shownote:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 通勤实际是一个新概念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="224">03:44</a> 女性平均通勤距离更短的原因是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="398">06:38</a> 通勤作为家庭身份和职场身份中的转换空间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">09:38</a> 通勤实际上是寻找自我的最好时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> 我的浪漫化通勤体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="976">16:16</a> 伦敦，北京，和纽约的通勤体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1566">26:06</a> 通勤也许是现代人少有的独处时间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1793">29:53</a> 当你通勤时，你都在干什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到的文章和书：</span></p><span></span><h3><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/78287.Wanderlust" data-url="https://www.goodreads.com/book/show/78287.Wanderlust"><span>Wanderlust: A History of Walking by Rebecca Solnit</span></a></h3><span></span><h1><a href="https://wagner.nyu.edu/rudincenter/2018/11/pink-tax-transportation-womens-challenges-mobility" data-url="https://wagner.nyu.edu/rudincenter/2018/11/pink-tax-transportation-womens-challenges-mobility"><span>The Pink Tax on Transportation: Women’s Challenges in Mobility</span></a></h1><span></span><p><a href="https://www.ons.gov.uk/releases/isthereagendercommutinggap" data-url="https://www.ons.gov.uk/releases/isthereagendercommutinggap"><span>Is there a gender commuting gap?</span></a></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/10.1177/08854129922092397" data-url="https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/10.1177/08854129922092397"><span>Women’s Employment and Commuting: Explaining the Links</span></a></h1><span></span><p><span>听友福利：</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在评论区分享本期节目的话题讨论，可以去我的微博: 函数ln 参与福利抽奖哦</span></p><span></span><p><span>Tezo购买渠道详见：复制【领券链接】69￥ CZ3457 qLbFdiFMtaH￥ <a data-url="https://m.tb.cn/h.Uovm4VN" href="https://m.tb.cn/h.Uovm4VN">m.tb.cn</a> Tezo Snowpea雪豆蓝牙耳机新款高级无线半入耳式超长续航迷你降噪</span></p>]]></description>
